{"title":"Virikh Dragonslayer","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 58 Skeleton that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">stab</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">shock</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/grave-rivet\">Grave Rivet</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/virikh-dragonslayer\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/virikh-dragonslayer?lv=58\">Lv 58 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/virikh-dragonslayer?lv=59\">Lv 59 <span>4</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/virikh-dragonslayer?lv=58\" title=\"Pick level 58\"><td><b>58</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>423</td><td>36.4</td><td>2,900</td><td class=\"muted\">1,269 · 51 · 8,700</td><td>1</td><td>in the wilds around 2054, 307</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/virikh-dragonslayer\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>59</b></td><td>440</td><td>37</td><td>2,950</td><td class=\"muted\">1,320 · 51.8 · 8,850</td><td>4</td><td>in the wilds around 2078, 304</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"virikh-dragonslayer\" data-map-level=\"59\">Show level 59 on the map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-5748.0px,-3811.7px)\"><img src=\"tiles/5/21/14.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:5376px;top:3584px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/21/15.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:5376px;top:3840px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/22/14.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:5632px;top:3584px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/22/15.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:5632px;top:3840px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/23/14.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:5888px;top:3584px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/23/15.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:5888px;top:3840px\"><i style=\"left:5689.0px;top:3788.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:5694.5px;top:3780.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:5740.5px;top:3868.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:5832.5px;top:3730.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:5783.8px;top:3890.2px\"></i></div></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around 2073, 305 <span class=\"muted\">· 5 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"virikh-dragonslayer\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Skeleton: <a href=\"#/monster/skeleton\">Skeleton</a> <span class=\"muted\">(7)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/skeleton-man-at-arms\">Skeleton Man-at-Arms</a> <span class=\"muted\">(36)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/skeleton-knight\">Skeleton Knight</a> <span class=\"muted\">(40)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/grave-knight\">Grave Knight</a> <span class=\"muted\">(44)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/knight-commander\">Knight-Commander</a> 